# Graph colors

All charts use `var(--graph-*)` tokens. Never raw hex.

Preferred sequence (Set 1 — use in order):
1. `--graph-starfleet-blue`
2. `--graph-pastel-violet`
3. `--graph-benevo-pink`
4. `--graph-sunflower`
5. `--graph-carrot`
6. `--graph-bright-green`
7. `--graph-turquoise`

Each has a compare variant: `--graph-[name]-compare` (lighter, for grouped/comparison charts)

Ratings (0–5 stars): iron → red → carrot → sunflower → bright-green → green

Social: `--graph-social-facebook/youtube/google/linkedin/x`

Full token list is in `src/tokens/theme.css` under `/* Graph colors */`.
